            "review_text": "Petitgiaco\nChambery, France477 contributions\n0\nGo your way...\nOct 2025 • Solo\nOct 2025 • Solo\nGo there only to photograph the front because it is a historic place but ABSOLUTELY not a place to eat a PHO. Staff without any commercial sense: no effort for the customer and the 2 Pho proposed (beef or chicken) are common worthy of a \"GOURBI\". It remains the storefront reminiscent of historic HCM hours. TO AVOID!!!\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten October 13, 2025",
