            "review_text": "Musicbones\nToronto, Canada117 contributions\n0\nHistoric restaurant\nNov 2017 • Friends\nAlthough, it appears a bit dingy, you wouldn't want it any other way - this is where the seeds of the Vietnamese revolution were germinated - and kept it's look as close as possible.\n\nThe food is fine - nothing great, but perfectly good.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 14, 2017",
