            "review_title": "Review at Thanh pho moi binh duong",
            "review_text": "Hannah T\nLuzon, Philippines167 contributions\n0\nExcellent Pho + History but Nothing Else\nAug 2017 • Friends\nThis historic pho place serves only beef and chicken Pho. If pho is what you want, then do visit the place. However, though the owner was friendly enough, no one speaks English so be ready with your translator if you want to hear more about the original owner and his visitors during the war years.\n\nThe good:\n\n- yummy authentic pho\n- fast service\n- no crowd\n- slice of history\n\nThe bad:\n\n- no other dishes\n- no English speakers to help translate \n- noisy TV is on\n\nThe neutral:\n\n- no fancy ambience (A negative if you like a nice restaurant feel. A positive if you like an authentic local feel.)\nRead more\nWritten August 10, 2017",
