            "review_title": "Review at Thanh pho moi binh duong",
            "review_text": "Lee\nYangon (Rangoon), Myanmar289 contributions\n0\nGo for the History and the Food\nFeb 2017 • Solo\nEat your Pho surrounded by history. The Vietcong planned attacks on American troops from the restaurant and rooms above. Delicious food only adds to the atmosphere. Beef Pho was amongst the best of the trip and the fizzy pop sold here called Saxi is probably the nearest thing you'll find to Dandilion and Burdock outside of Britain.\n\nDon't think all this fame will cost you though, even those on the tightest of budgets could dine here.\nRead more\nWritten February 10, 2017",
