            "review_text": "russell c\naustralia411 contributions\n0\nFascinating, and good soup.\nJan 2017 • Family\nHad a great bowl of pho here plus got the stories of the former owner and his role in the resistance. Then the bonus of a tour of the 'room' upstairs. Very worth a visit to hear the stories and see the memorabilia on top of your bowl of pho\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 13, 2017",
